ies within grasp\u2014aid him at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Epic Narrative: A Multilinear Mystery]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive Storytelling: 250,000+ words of meticulously crafted prose unveil the merciless survival laws of the continent of Hel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interwoven Perspectives: Employing a multi-POV narrative structure, each chapter advances through distinct protagonists' viewpoints. Initially fragmented storylines gradually converge into a mosaic of revelations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery of Blood and Threads: Truth lies scattered across perspectives like puzzle shards. Only by traversing every character's fate can players reconstruct the ultimate narrative closure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/e8ab9a769a399807ecc4cdbd4c3b10ca.avif?t=1752639065\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Sensory Pilgrimage]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Meticulously crafted stages breathe life into a hauntingly beautiful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Multiple CGs and Gothic-styled character portraits amplify the unique art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Melancholic melodies intertwine with storytelling for therapeutic immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/5c3c58fcd0ab1f5895c768feb0635a44.avif?t=1752639065\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Barrier-Free Narrative]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Exclusive Lazy Mode delivers seamless narrative consumption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Prioritized emotional design \u2013 witness every plot twist without interruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/823a76ddd583122c82f1ac521ee03316.avif?t=1752639065\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[A Combat-Integrated Visual Novel]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Card duels evolve organically with plot developments, forging a symbiotic story-mechanics relationship that deepens narrative immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. With narrative progression, players will encounter various characters and can recruit some of them as allies during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Classic roguelike setup demands tactical adaptation against escalating chapter Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/1479ce735bd14a93f751e4357bb1453c.avif?t=1752639065\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stage Crew Member\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Staff\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production Team\uff1aSword Lantern</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Producer\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Script/Direction\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u4e39\u54e5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copywriting\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy Editing/Configuration/Production Assista